---
config:
  themeVariables:
    fontFamily: '"Noto Sans CJK SC", "PingFang SC", sans-serif'
---
flowchart TD
    Key["<b>数据包 / 流键</b><br/>src、dst、mark、TOS、<br/>输入/输出接口"]

    Scan["<b>按优先级顺序扫描规则</b><br/>优先级数值最小者优先<br/>某个操作返回路由时停止"]

    Rule["<b>每条规则 = 谓词 + 目标</b><br/><b>谓词：</b>from 10.99.0.0/24<br/><b>目标：</b>lookup table 100"]

    Table["<b>选中的路由表</b><br/>在 local、main、default<br/>或自定义表中执行最长前缀查找"]

    Result["<b>fib_result</b><br/>路由 type、下一跳、scope、<br/>metrics、首选源地址"]

    Miss["<b>不匹配 / 无路由</b><br/>继续下一条规则；<br/>若都未产生路由，则查找失败"]

    Key --> Scan --> Rule --> Table --> Result
    Table -. 查找未命中 .-> Miss -. 下一条规则 .-> Scan

    Defaults["<b>默认规则顺序</b><br/>0 → local table<br/>32766 → main table<br/>32767 → default table"]
    Scan -. 典型内置规则 .-> Defaults

    classDef key fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb,stroke-width:2px
    classDef rule fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,stroke-width:2px
    classDef out fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    classDef miss fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626,stroke-width:2px
    class Key key
    class Scan,Rule,Defaults rule
    class Table,Result out
    class Miss miss
